# good: the pilot loop. Loads at level 1, wires on top at level 2.
kits scb20
grid 7x5 grid-mini
step 1: grid
step 2: B3B at 1A dir=right side=up level=1
step 3: S1 at 1C dir=down level=1
step 4: L4 at 3E dir=up level=1
step 5: wire3 at 1A dir=down level=2
step 6: wire3 at 1E dir=right level=2
step 7: wire3 at 3C dir=up level=2
scene watch: S1=on
expect S1=off: L4 off
expect S1=on: L4 on
expect S1=on, remove=6: L4 off
expect S1=on, swap=4/M7: M7 on fwd
expect S1=on, swap=4/W1: W1 on
